$$CROSS_CHECK_JSON$$

- 3.5 (premise expansion, finished)
$$PREMISE_EXPANSION_JSON$$

- 3.5v (its fidelity check)
$$PREMISE_EXPANSION_FIDELITY_JSON$$

- 3.75 (the craft spine to repair)
$$CRAFT_SPINE_JSON$$

